# The vendored bridge is byte-compared against a freshly rendered upstream copy
# (test/plugin.test.mjs). Git's autocrlf rewrites CRLF into the working tree,
# which makes that comparison fail on a Windows checkout while passing in CI.
# Force LF for the files this repository generates and compares byte-for-byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
lib/vendor/mcp-bridge.js text eol=lf
verify/vendor-bridge.mjs text eol=lf